---
title: Activity 5 - Visit List Access Flow
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User requests patient visit history]
    B --> C{Authenticated?}
    C -- No --> D[401 Unauthorized]
    D --> Z([End])
    C -- Yes --> E[Resolve patient record\nfrom route parameter]
    E --> F{Patient exists?}
    F -- No --> G[404 Not Found]
    G --> Z
    F -- Yes --> H{What is the user role?}
    H -- admin --> I[Load all visits for patient]
    H -- doktor --> I
    H -- pacijent --> J{Requesting own visits?}
    J -- No --> K[403 Forbidden]
    K --> Z
    J -- Yes --> I
    I --> L[Eager load doctor info per visit]
    L --> M[Return VisitResource collection]
    M --> Z
